## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Quick Chat|r 0.2.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Keeps eight chat messages you wrote in the settings, shows them as an extra page of the D-pad up wheel (right after Emotes) and puts the chosen one into the chat box, on the channel you picked, ready to send.
## Version: 0.2.0
## AddOnVersion: 1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsQuickChat_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua
Core.lua
Chat.lua
Wheel.lua
Settings.lua
Main.lua

